  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 2f4848e7e46289243b311920bdbdddf0, type: 3}
  m_Name: AI
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  playerLines:
  - AI seems like magic to me, I write something in and it magicall give me a response
  - Seems like its straight out of science fiction
  - I'm a bit worried about society getting taken over though
  - <i>hmm...</i>
  - <i>If I'm patient enough, I may be able to figure out and exploit the actions
    of AI</i>
  NPCLines:
  - Artificial beings have been speculated about since ancient times with stories
    of Talos and Paracelsis
  - Nowadays, AI seems to be a common part of society
  - Most people don't seem to understand AI but they may be simpler than you think
  - They aim to imitate the human ability to learn by trying to find the best solution
    to several equations
  - They iteratively learn over time to achieve this
  - One of the first instances of neural networks appeared in 1943 by Walter Pitts
    and Warren McCulloch
  - AI istelf has several different fields such as reinforcement learning, deep learning,
    computer vision and more
  - At the end of the day, AI is just a series of self-learning equations, given
    enough thought and patience, they can be exploited
  speakTurnPlayer: 01000000000001000001000101
